P2para.Text:
In section 136(7) of the Enterprise Act 2002 (investigations and reports on market investigation references: relevant sectoral enactments), at the end of paragraph (g) insert “
                    or section 60 of the Civil Aviation Act 2012;
                  ”.

P3para.Text:
in paragraph (b), for the words from  “the minimum charges” to the end substitute “
                        goods, services and other benefits which are or are not to be provided by any person in prescribed circumstances;
                      ”, and

in sections 71A(1) and (3) and 71B(2)(a) of the Civil Aviation Act 1982 (contributions by licence holders to Air Travel Trust) for  “71” substitute “
                        71(1)
                      ”;
